# Fallen Comrades (bastok 19): Pavvke in Bastok Mines. The guard (Bastok fame level 2), the silver name tag trade: 91
# while accepted, 92 once completed (the second section matches accepted and completed), each completing the quest
# again; 92 adds 10 more Bastok fame. Pavvke's default is 75; Out of the Depths, The Eleventh's Hour and missions 5-2 and
# 8-2 also name him, and this char meets none of them.
lists BastokMines/Pavvke/onTrigger BastokMines/Pavvke/onTrade BastokMines/onEventFinish/90 BastokMines/onEventFinish/91 BastokMines/onEventFinish/92
char zone=BastokMines pos=16.6,6.985,-13.8
fame Bastok 49
item SilverNameTag
item SilverNameTag
item SilverNameTag
item BoneChip
login
trade Pavvke SilverNameTag x1   # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Pavvke                  # fame 49 (level 1): his default 75
finish
fame Bastok 50
trigger Pavvke                  # fame level 2: the offer, 90
finish                          # accepted
trigger Pavvke                  # accepted: no trigger in section 2, 75
finish
trade Pavvke BoneChip x1        # the wrong item: nothing
trade Pavvke SilverNameTag x1   # not completed yet: 91
finish                          # completed: 550 gil, fame +10, a tag gone
trigger Pavvke                  # completed: 75
finish
trade Pavvke SilverNameTag x1   # completed: 92
finish                          # completed again: 550 gil, fame +10 and +10 more, a tag gone
